---
import Layout from '~/layouts/Layout.astro'
import ProfileAvatar from '~/components/ProfileAvatar.astro'
import ExperienceTimeline from '~/components/ExperienceTimeline.astro'
import SectionIntro from '~/components/SectionIntro.astro'
---

<Layout
  title="关于我"
  description="我是 Aritx Zhou，也叫音唯。这里是我的学习、开发与实习经历。"
>
  <div class="about-intro">
    <SectionIntro
      label="关于我"
      title="音唯，也叫 Aritx Zhou。"
      description="来自武汉，在南京大学读书。写代码，做电子音乐，也会在模拟飞行里给自己安排一趟远行。"
      ><span slot="title"
        >音唯，也叫<br /><span class="name-together">Aritx Zhou.</span></span
      ><a class="md-button tonal" href="mailto:aritxonly@outlook.com">来聊聊 ↗</a
      ></SectionIntro
    ><div class="about-portrait">
      <span class="portrait-caption">A FEW SIDES OF ME</span>
      <div class="about-avatar"><ProfileAvatar /></div>
      <span class="portrait-tag portrait-tag-code" aria-hidden="true"
        >&lt;/&gt; 写代码</span
      >
      <span class="portrait-tag portrait-tag-music" aria-hidden="true">♫ 做音乐</span>
      <span class="portrait-signature">Aritx Zhou</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="personal-notes">
    <div>
      <span class="note-symbol" aria-hidden="true">{'{ }'}</span><h2>平时在折腾</h2><p>
        Go 后端、多端原生应用、智能体与多模态。从好奇开始，做着做着就认真了。
      </p>
    </div><div>
      <span class="note-symbol note-sound" aria-hidden="true"
        ><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span
      ><h2>耳机里的另一面</h2><p>
        Melodic Dubstep、Colour Bass，旋律系 Bass 乐爱好者。<a href="/music"
          >来听听我的作品 ↗</a
        >
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <section id="journey" class="home-section">
    <div class="section-top">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">走过的几站 / MY JOURNEY</p><h2>一路折腾，几线并行。</h2>
      </div>
    </div><ExperienceTimeline />
  </section>
  <div class="page-note">
    代码之外，也想多认识些有趣的人。可以给我<a href="mailto:aritxonly@outlook.com"
      >发邮件</a
    >，或去 <a href="https://github.com/AritxOnly">GitHub</a> 打个招呼。
  </div>
</Layout>
